Index: aic8800/src/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/rwnx_rx.c
===================================================================
--- aic8800.orig/src/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/rwnx_rx.c
